5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is a pleasure to meet you all. I hope we can approach this selection with kindness and a shared desire to support the researchers who will carry our science forward. I look forward to our talk.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Thank you, Shizue. I agree that a thoughtful approach is necessary. I believe we should prioritize a realistic assessment of the resources available to ensure the chosen project can actually be executed.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I agree with Ryuji. A proposal's merit is only as strong as the infrastructure supporting it. I believe we should look closely at the current state of our shared services to ensure they can handle new demands.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, Victoria. A brilliant proposal is merely a blueprint; the actual construction requires a stable foundation. I believe a pragmatic look at the operational and financial margins would be most illuminating for us all.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Thank you, everyone. I am very happy to be here with you. I agree that harmony and stability are important, and I hope we can find a project that is truly sustainable for the researchers.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"It is so lovely to see us all in agreement. To make sure we are being fair to the researchers, I believe we should look at the closeout files of finished awards and the portfolio review of schedule overruns.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,I believe we must identify where the actual human capacity lies. I will examine the staffing rolls for technical posts and the minutes on secondments and crew strength to see who is truly available.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"To understand the pressure on our shared infrastructure, I will look into the accreditation and bookings at shared facilities and the incident logs on shared instrumentation. I want to see if the equipment is actually available.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"A most prudent division of labor. To uncover the shifting sands of our financial reality, I shall examine the travel and bench-fee lines in the ledgers and the national computing agreement and facility day rates.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,I think it would be very helpful to know where projects usually run into trouble. I will look into the portfolio review of schedule overruns and the closeout files of finished awards to see what causes delays.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,It seems we have a very thoughtful plan. I am glad that Midori and I are looking into the same records; perhaps we can share our perspectives on the patterns we find.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,That sounds reasonable. I believe our combined findings will provide a clear picture of both the structural and human constraints we must consider before making a final decision.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"I agree. By combining our findings on staffing, financial margins, and facility availability, we can avoid the mistake of funding a project that is theoretically sound but operationally impossible.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a comforting thought, Victoria. I suspect that the truth often hides in the discrepancy between a proposal's ambition and the actual cost of its maintenance. I look forward to seeing where those frictions lie.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I agree, Benjamin. It would be a shame if a wonderful project suffered because of things the researchers couldn't control. I hope our findings help us protect them from those kinds of surprises.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I feel a great sense of peace knowing we are all working together so harmoniously. I wish you all clarity and insight in your research. I shall see you all again soon.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,1,4,pass,Shizue,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. Let us proceed with our investigations. I look forward to seeing how the human capacity aligns with the ambitions of the proposals. Until we reconvene.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,1,4,pass,Ryuji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I concur. I hope the records provide a clear picture of our current capacity so we can make a responsible choice. I look forward to our next discussion.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,1,4,pass,Victoria,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,A most optimistic start to our proceedings. I shall now retreat into the archives to see if the ledgers reflect a generous reality or a shrinking one. I wish you all a productive investigation.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,1,4,pass,Benjamin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,1,4,talk,Midori,,I am looking forward to it as well! I hope we can find a path that ensures the researchers can focus on their science without any unexpected worries. See you all soon!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
29,1,4,pass,Midori,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
